  "body": "This release resolves an issue preventing Homebrew cask updates during automated releases, updates the Go toolchain to 1.26, and updates project dependencies.\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- Ensure Homebrew cask updates publish successfully during the release workflow by using an automation token with protected branch access and verifying the published version (#102).\n\n### Maintenance\n\n- Update Go version to 1.26.0.\n- Update release notes generation script to use the latest Gemini flash model endpoint.\n\n### Dependencies\n\n- Bump `github.com/urfave/cli/v3` to v3.13.0.\n- Bump project dependencies, including `testify`, `golang.org/x/sys`, and `golang.org/x/term`.\n"
